<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Nyamwezi</book>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ki'tabu cha Luti</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luti</para>
  <para style="imt">Mihayo zya Mbele zya Ki'tabu cha Luti</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki'tabu cha Luti ki'li'gani'la magambo ga ku'kumya, ago gagu'sangaga mugana gu'mo gwa V'aizilaeli ha itungo lya v'ayangu'zi v'a Izilaeli. Naomi, hu' mayu' wa mugana gwenu'go, ali'fwi'lwa na mugosi haki'mo na v'ana v'av'o v'av'i'li' v'a ki'gosya. Aho gav'i'taga genago, Naomi ali'pokela lu'v'ango aho Luti, yu'mo mugati' na v'akamwana na mwikazi wa nsi' ya Mowabu, ali'lagi'la chelu' ku' moyo gwakwe kwilonda na mukwiye na ku'mugwasya. Naomi ali'wu'ka musi'nzo haki'mo na Luti ku'su'v'a ku' nsi' yakwe ya Izilaeli. Aho lyav'i'ta lyeni'lo, Luti na Naomi v'ose v'isanga v'ali'pokela lu'v'ango. Bowasi, yu'mo mugati' na v'a bi'hi' na igongo lyamwa Naomi, ali'sola wu'timbu wa ku'v'akomola na ku'zumya ku'mutoola Luti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itungo lya v'ayangu'zi lyav'age itungo iv'i ku' V'aizilaeli, ku'nguno v'ingi v'av'o v'av'age v'ikalile ninga ku'londa ng'o nzi'la ya nhana. Ali'vi Naomi, Luti na Bowasi v'av'age v'ali' na nsembo nsoga ya kwikola ku'londekezya mugati' na V'aizilaeli av'o v'av'age v'ali' na wikalo wa ku'londa nzi'la ya nhana yamwa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku'du'hu' ninga yu'mo u'yo amanyile ku'v'a nde u'yo waki'tona ki'tabu cha Luti. Hangi' ninga itungo i'lo chatonwa ki'tabu cheni'chi' li'kamanyi'ka. Ali'vi v'ingi v'ali'wiganika ku'v'a ki'tabu cheni'chi' chatonwa itungo i'lo V'aizilaeli v'asangwa v'akaku'fuma ku' Babuloni ku' wu'sese, ku'londana na mukoli gwa wu'tonwe wa Ki'ebulania u'go gwatu'mi'ka ku' ki'tabu cheni'ki'li'.</para>
  <para style="ip">Li'li' igambo ihanya ku'v'a mutemi Dav'idi wav'age mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Luti, muki'ma u'yo ndi' akav'ile Muizilaeli. Yeni'yi' yi'li'lagi'la ku'v'a muki'ma mwenu'yu' ali' na lwandi' ku' v'antu' v'a kale v'a igongo lyamwa Yesu. Igambo lyeni'li' li'li'wigengeleka ku'v'a nhana ku'v'a bi'hi' na Mulungu ku'kav'ile ku'londana na wu'sogolwe wa mugana, sumbwa ku'londana na moyo gwa muntu'.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mihayo ku' Wu'guhi'</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ifungu lya 1 li'li'gani'la mmola zya mugana gwamwa Naomi na ki'li'lo ki'hanya i'cho ki'li'v'apandi'ka, na hangi' i'vyo Naomi na Luti v'ali'su'v'a ku' Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ifungu lya 2 li'li'gani'la i'vyo Luti ali'poma na Bowasi aho wav'age ali'wi'mi'li'zya mili'mo zya wi'mbu'zi ku' migu'nda zyakwe. Luti wav'age ali'salala nsalazyo ya viliwa u'lu' v'i'mbu'zi v'amali'la ku'kuminga.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ifungu lya 3 li'li'gani'la i'vyo Naomi ali'mulagi'li'zya Luti ku'mukoov'a Bowasi amutoole na ku'musu'nga, ku'nguno wav'age wa igongo lyakwe lya bi'hi' ku'londana na wu'bi'hi' wa ku'musaala. Aho lyav'i'taga lyeni'li' Bowasi ali'zumya ku'sola wu'timbu wenu'wo.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ifungu lya 4 li'li'welezezya i'vyo Bowasi ali'gu'la mugu'nda u'go gwav'age nsawo ya muyagi mugosi wamwa Naomi, na hangi' ku'mutoola Luti.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimeleki na mugana gwakwe v'ali'ya ku' Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Yav'age ha itungo lya kale, aho v'ayangu'zi v'av'age v'atemile mu nsi' ya Izilaeli, nzala ndi' yagwa mu nsi' yeni'yo. Wav'age ali'ho muntu' yu'mo lina lyakwe Elimeleki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Elimeleki” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Mulungu ali' mutemi.”</char></note> wa mu kaya ya Betelehemu, ya mu Yuda, haki'mo na muki' wakwe u'yo witanagwe Naomi, na v'ana v'av'o v'av'i'li' v'a ki'gosya, mina gav'o Maloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Maloni” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'lwile.”</char></note> na Kilioni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Kilioni” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'tagi'ki.”</char></note>. V'awonaga v'aye ku'kikala ku' nsi' ya Mowabu ki'ti' v'ageni. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />V'antu' v'enav'a v'av'age v'a igongo lya V'aefulati, v'a ku' kaya ya Betelehemu ku' nsi' yamwa Yuda. Ku'nguno ya nzala v'awu'kaga ku'ya ku'kikala ku' nsi' ya Mowabu ki'ti' v'ageni v'izi'li'zi. V'afikaga ku' nsi' ya Mowabu na v'ikalaga kwenu'ko.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Mugati' na wikalo wav'o kwenu'ko, Elimeleki, mugosi wamwa Naomi, wagulalaga. Naomi walekagwa haki'mo na v'aane v'av'i'li'. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />V'asu'mbana v'enav'a v'atoolaga v'aniki' v'a Ki'mowabu, na mina gav'o v'itanagwe yu'mo Olipa na wa wu'v'i'li' Luti. V'ikalaga nav'o kwenu'ko ku' itungo lya ki'ti' myaka iku'mi. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Haho Maloni na Kilioni nav'o v'agulalaga. Hohene muki'ma mwenu'yu' wav'a wafwi'lwa na mugosi haki'mo na v'aane v'av'i'li'.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Luti v'ali'su'v'a ku' Betelehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Aho Naomi wigagwa mmola ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'izi'i'lile v'antu' v'akwe na wav'apile viliwa, haho wawonaga awu'ke ku'fuma ku' Mowabu na ku'su'v'a ku' wav'o, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na v'akamwana v'akwe. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Hohene v'awu'kaga ku'fuma aho v'av'age v'ikalile, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na v'akamwana v'akwe v'av'i'li', na v'adimaga nzi'la ya ku'su'v'i'la ku' nsi' yamwa Yuda.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Haho Naomi wav'awi'laga v'akamwana v'akwe, “Su'v'agi, ki'la yu'mo aye ku' lu'go lwamwa nnina. Gu'ku' Mulungu akamuv'ezezye chelu' ki'ti' i'vi inywe mwambezezizye ene haki'mo na v'antu' v'anne av'o v'agulalile. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Gu'ku' Mulungu amutongelele, ki'la yu'mo akapandi'ke mugosya, na ku'v'a na wikalo wu'soga mu lu'go lwakwe.” Haho wav'asu'naga, nav'o v'ali'laga ku' muzwi muhanya <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />na ku'yomba, “Ayi' ng'o! Ku'ku'su'v'a haki'mo nanho ku' v'antu' v'ako.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Ali'vi Naomi wav'awi'laga, “Inywe v'ana v'anne, su'v'agi! Ku' ki' mwilonde nanne? Vihe, muli'wiganika ku'v'a nkowolile hangi' ku'v'yala v'ana v'a ki'gosya ki'gele v'av'e v'agosi v'inywe? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />V'ana v'anne, su'v'agi ku' winywe, ku'nguno ene nakiku'lile na nkakowola ku'toolwa hangi'. Ninga mbe nali' njombe ati' ni'na isigi'zyo lya ku'toolwa wu'ziku' wa walelo, na ku'pandi'ka v'ana v'a ki'gosya, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />vihe, mwali' muku'kowola ku'lindi'la v'aku'le? Ninga vihe, mwali' muku'kowola kwilambi'ki'zya ku'du' mutoolwe na v'agosya v'angi'? Yi'kav'ile vyene v'ana v'anne, ku'nguno yi'li' vilambu ku' wanne ku'ki'la ku' winywe, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wampile lu'duko lu'hanya.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Nav'o v'ali'laga hangi' ku' muzwi muhanya. Olipa wamusu'naga mukwiye na ku'mudahya, sumbwa Luti wamung'ang'ani'laga mukwiye. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Haho Naomi wamuwi'laga Luti, “Lingaga, mudu'gu'yo asu'v'ile ku' lu'go lwav'o, ku' v'antu' v'akwe na ku' mulungu wakwe, nanho su'v'a wilonde na mudu'gu'yo.” <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ali'vi Luti wasu'v'yaga,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="RUT 1:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">“U'leke ku'nikonga nku'leke ev'e,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">ninga ku'du' u'ngizye ku'ku'londa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">U'ko u'ku'ya, nanne nku'ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">na u'ko u'lakikale nanne ndakikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">V'antu' v'ako v'alav'e v'antu' v'anne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">na Mulungu wako alav'e Mulungu wanne.<verse eid="RUT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />U'ko u'lakafwi'le nanne ndafwi'le kwenu'ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">na kwene ku'ko ndazyi'ki'lwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">Gu'ku' Mulungu ampe lu'duko lu'hanya u'lu' nize ndekane nanho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">sumbwa lu'fu du' lu'laku'lekanie.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi aho wawonaga ku'v'a Luti ali' na ndaka ya ku'ya nawe, walekaga ku'mwikonga.<figure style="fig" file="co00956.jpg" size="col" ref="1:18">Luti ali'mwikonga Naomi awu'ke nawe</figure> <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Haho v'endeleyaga na musi'nzo v'ose v'av'i'li' ku'ya ku' Betelehemu. Aho v'afikaga kwenu'ko, v'antu' v'ose v'akumyaga, na v'aki'ma v'iwu'zyaga ati', “Vihe, u'yu' hu' Naomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi wav'awi'laga ati', “Ku'du' munitane hangi' Naomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Naomi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “musoga”.</char></note>, sumbwa munitane Mala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Mala” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'satu” ninga “wu'lu'lu'.”</char></note>, ku'nguno Mulungu wa Nguzu wambezezyaga magambo ga wu'satu muno. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Aho ndi' nu'wu'ka henanha, nav'age ngelani'lile ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wansu'v'yaga makono du'. Ku' ki' muli'nitana Naomi? Gu'ku' Mulungu wampile lu'duko, nawe Mulungu wa Nguzu wampile makoye.”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />I'vi hu' vyene Naomi haki'mo na Luti, Mumowabu, mukamwana wakwe, v'asu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Mowabu, na ku'fiki'i'la ku' Betelehemu. Itungo lyeni'lo yav'age hu' ntangi'lo ya lyi'mbu'la lya shayili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Shayili” zili' mpese zya wikole na ngano.</char></note>.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ku'poma kwamwa Luti na Bowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />U'yu' Naomi wav'age na mudu'gu' wa mugosi, wa igongo lyamwa Elimeleki, lina lyakwe witanagwe Bowasi, muntu' mukumalu'ku na mundev'a. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Luti, Mumowabu, wamuwi'laga mukwiye Naomi ati', “Nu'lomba nje mu migu'nda nkasalale viliwa vya shayili, ha nnuma ya mwi'mbu'zi u'yo aku'nzumi'zya.” Nawe Naomi wasu'v'yaga, “Endita mwana wanne, yaga.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Haho Luti wayaga mu migu'nda ku'kasalala ha nnuma ya v'i'mbu'zi viliwa i'vyo v'ali'lekela. Kasinaga wav'age ali' mu mugu'nda gwamwa Bowasi, u'yo wa igongo lyamwa Elimeleki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo Bowasi wizaga ku' mugu'nda gwakwe ku'fuma ku' lu'go lwakwe ku' Betelehemu. Wav'agisyaga v'i'mbu'zi ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu av'e na inywe.” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'dosye.” <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Hangi' Bowasi wamuwu'zyaga mwi'mi'li'zi wa v'i'mbu'zi v'akwe, “Ali' u'yo mwaniki' wamwa nde?” <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Mwi'mi'li'zi wasu'v'yaga ati', “Mwaniki' mwenu'yo ali' Mumowabu, u'yo wizile haki'mo na Naomi ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Mowabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Wizaga walomba ku'muleke asalale nsalazyo ya viliwa ha nnuma na v'i'mbu'zi. Nawe wadi'laga ali'tu'mama ku'fuma ndiyu', sumbwa wali' wayaga ku'kasuuha ku' mutaka ku' itungo ido.”<figure style="fig" file="co00964.jpg" size="col" ref="2:7">Bowasi na mwi'mi'li'zi wa v'i'mbu'zi v'akwe v'ali'musu'nsu'mu'li'la Luti</figure><verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Nawe Bowasi wayaga ku'kamuwi'la Luti, “Degeleka mwana wanne, ku'du' u'ye ku'kasalala mu mugu'nda gu'ngi', sumbwa mu mugu'nda gwenu'gu' du'. Ilondage na v'enav'a v'atu'mami v'anne v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Minso gako galinge mu mugu'nda u'go v'ali'wi'mbu'la v'asu'mbana, nanho u'v'alonde. Nav'akaani'zyaga v'enav'a ku'du' v'aku'tusye. Hangi' u'lu' wakolwa nota, u'v'e u'li'ya du' ku'kanywa ha mizoga zya minzi' ago v'adahile v'asu'mbana v'enav'a.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Luti wamusungami'laga na ku'muku'v'i'i'la Bowasi na ku'yomba ati', “Nav'a na wu'soga ki' ku' wako ninga ku'nfwi'la ki'sa ene mugeni?” <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Nawe Bowasi wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nigilwe yose i'yo wamuv'ezezizye mukwiyo, ku'fuma ku'gulala kwa mugosi wako. Manyile i'vyo wav'alekile v'av'yazi v'ako, na ku'yi'leka nsi' i'yo wav'yali'lwa, na wizile kwikala na v'antu' av'o u'kav'amanyile ku'fuma mbu'ki'. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'su'v'i'zye ku' gose ago wav'ezizye. U'dosiwe ku' twingi na Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, u'yo wapeelelile mu manana gakwe.” <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Haho Luti wayombaga, “Gu'ku' wanne, ev'e wambezezyaga wu'soga wu'hanya muno. Wayomba nanne ku' wu'soga wa moyo, na wampaga ihu'li'kyo lya moyo ninga i'vi ene nkav'ile ki'ti' yu'mo mugati' na v'atu'mami v'ako v'a ki'ki'ma.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Ha itungo lya ku'lya, Bowasi wamuwi'laga Luti ati', “Kaliwu' hano, izu'u' u'lye niswe, u'mege mugate na u'kozye mu ki'neneko.” Nawe Luti wikalaga haki'mo na v'i'mbu'zi, nav'o v'amupaga mbutoo zya wu'komelwe. Walyaga na wiku'taga mpaka walekelaga. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Aho wawu'kaga hangi' ku'ya ku'kasalala viliwa, Bowasi wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'atu'mami v'akwe, “Muleki asolele ninga bi'hi' na matuntu ga masapali u'mo gali', ku'du' mumuhame. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Hangi', mukweseli ngala ku'fuma mu masapali mulagazye ki'gele asolele, ku'du' mumugizye.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Haho Luti wasolelaga viliwa mu mugu'nda mpaka mpi'ndi', na wavigu'magu'laga viliwa vyeni'vyo na kokazya ki'ti' idebe li'mo na wu'sago. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Wasombaga viliwa vyeni'vyo na wayaga mpaka ku' kaya ku' lu'go lwamwa nnina wu'kwi, na ku'mulagi'la i'vyo wasolelaga. Hangi' Luti wafumyaga ki'liwa i'cho walekelaga aho wali' wiku'ta, na wamupaga. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Hohene mukwiye wamuwu'zyaga, “Ali', wasalalaga ku'he walelo? Watu'mami'laga ku'he? Adosiwe muntu' u'yo waku'lawaga.” Haho Luti wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa nnina wu'kwi ati', “Natu'mamaga ku' mugu'nda gwa muntu' yu'mo lina lyakwe Bowasi.” <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Nawe Naomi wamuwi'laga mukamwana wakwe ati', “Mwenu'yu' adosiwe na Gu'ku' Mulungu, u'yo akalekile ku'lagi'la chelu' chakwe, ku' v'apanga, ninga ku' av'o v'amalile ku'gulala.” Hangi' wamuwi'laga, “Muntu' mwenu'yo ali' mudu'gu' wiswe wa bi'hi', yu'mo mugati' na v'adu'gu' av'o yi'li'v'adima ku'ku'saala iswe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Hangi' Luti Mumowabu wayombaga ati', “Ninga vyeni'vyo wali' wambwi'laga ati', ‘Wikale haki'mo na v'atu'mami v'anne, mpaka aho v'alakamale kwi'mbu'la viliwa vyanne vyose.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Haho Naomi wasu'v'yaga, “Mwana wanne, yi'li' visoga wilonde haki'mo na v'atu'mami v'akwe v'a ki'ki'ma, ki'gele v'antu' v'aleke ku'ku'sukyansukya mu mugu'nda gwa muntu' yu'ngi'.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Luti wilondaga na v'atu'mami v'amwa Bowasi, na wasolelaga viliwa vya shayili na ngano ha itungo lyose lya lyi'mbu'la. Mugati' na nsiku' zyose zyeni'zyo Luti wav'age ikalile na nnina wu'kwi.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Luti na Bowasi ha lu'mbu'ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Naomi wamuwi'laga mukamwana wakwe Luti ati', “Mwana wanne, yi'li'ndima nku'koov'ele mugosya ki'gele u'pandi'ke wu'soga. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Mwenu'yu' Bowasi, u'yo u'li'v'aga u'li'tu'mama mili'mo haki'mo na v'atu'mami v'akwe, ali' wa igongo liswe lya bi'hi'. Wu'ziku' wa walelo aku'v'a ali'heha shayili ku' lu'mbu'ga lwakwe. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, woge, wiv'ile maguta, na u'zwali'le visoga, haho u'ye ku' lu'mbu'ga. Ali'vi ku'du' wiyoleche ku' muntu' mwenu'yo mpaka aho aku'v'a wamali'la ku'lya na ku'nywa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Aho li'ku'v'a lyafika itungo lya ku'lala, u'halawe aho aku'lala. U'lu' twamuv'i'ti'la tu'lo u'mwiv'ende hado hado, u'kagakumbu'lu'le<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luti ku'mukumbu'lu'la magu'lu' wav'age ali'mulomba Bowasi amusaale.</char></note> magu'lu' gakwe, na u'lale henanho, nawe aku'ku'wi'la lya ku'v'ezya.” <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luti wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'yi'v'ezya yose i'yo wambwi'laga.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Haho Luti wayaga ku' lu'mbu'ga, na wav'ezyaga yose ki'ti' i'vyo wawi'lagwa na mukwiye.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Yav'aga mwenu'yu' Bowasi aho wamali'laga ku'lya na ku'nywa, watogeziv'agwa mu moyo gwakwe. Hohene wayaga ku'kalala ku' mpelo na ituntu lya shayili. Haho Luti wamwiv'endaga hado hado, wagakumbu'lu'laga magu'lu' gamwa Bowasi na walalaga henanho. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Yav'aga mu wu'ziku' wa hagati', Bowasi wapampamuki'laga. Aho ali'galu'ka wawonaga, kasinaga hali' na muki'ma alalile mu magu'lu' gakwe! <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Haho wawu'zyaga, “U'li' nde ev'e?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga, “Ene ni' Luti, muzya wako. Sansamula mwenda gwako u'nkumbi'le, ku'nguno ev'e hu' u'li' wa igongo lya bi'hi' wa ku'nsaala.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Bowasi wayombaga ati', “Mwana wanne, Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'dosye, ku'nguno walagi'laga chelu' ki'hanya ku'ki'la ha mbu'ki', nguno u'kav'alondile v'asu'mbana v'asav'i ninga v'api'na. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Gi'si' mwana wanne, ku'du' wogohe. Ku'nguno v'antu' v'ose mu kaya yeni'yi' v'aku'manyile ku'v'a ev'e u'li' muki'ma wa nsembo nsoga. Nku'ku'v'ezezya vyose i'vyo walombaga. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Hangi' yi'li' nhana ku'v'a ene ni' wa igongo lyako wa bi'hi', ali'vi ali'ho muntu' mu igongo liswe u'yo wa bi'hi' ku'ki'la ene. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Ev'e ikalaga henanha wu'ziku' wenu'wu', na ndiyu' mbe wazumya ku'ku'saala, yi'li' visoga. Ali'vi mbe wiza wakaana mweni'ki'li', nhanayene nu'lahi'la ku' lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, nku'ku'komola ki'ti' i'vyo yi'li'koov'iwa ku' wa igongo. Ev'e lalaga henanha mpaka ndiyu'.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Hohene Luti walalaga henanho ha magu'lu' gakwe mpaka mu ikingilima, haho wipunaga aho v'antu' v'akaali' ku'lamula ku'wona visoga, ku'nguno Bowasi ndi' wamuwi'laga, “Ku'du' yi'manyi'ke ku'v'a muki'ma wali' wizaga ha lu'mbu'ga.” <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga, “Leta mwenda gwako u'go u'zwalile, wanze.” Nawe wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. Bowasi wasuki'laga shayili ngelo mukaga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngelo mukaga ziki'lile kilo maku'mi av'i'li'.</char></note> na wamutwi'kaga. Haho muki'ma mwenu'yo wasu'v'aga ku' kaya. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Aho wafikaga ku' lu'go, mukwiye wamuwu'zyaga, “Mwana wanne, yakwi'laga vihe kwenu'ko?” Luti wamutentemuli'laga yose i'yo Bowasi wamuv'ezezyaga. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Walambaga ku'yomba ati', “Wampaga shayili zyeni'zi ngelo mukaga, na ku'mbwi'la ‘Ku'du' u'su'v'e makono du' ku' mukwiyo.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Haho Naomi wamuwi'laga Luti ati', “Mwana wanne, tekana mpaka u'wone i'vyo yi'ku'v'a, ku'nguno Bowasi akalembele walelo mpaka ali'gelani'zye igambo lyeni'li'.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Bowasi ali'musaala Luti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Hohene Bowasi wayaga ku'kikala ku' wingi'li'lo wa kaya, u'ko v'antu' v'ali'v'aga v'ali'wikuminga. Yav'aga u'yo mudu'gu' wamwa Elimeleki wa bi'hi' wa ku'komola, u'yo Bowasi ndi' wamukania, wav'i'taga henanho. Bowasi wamuwi'laga, “Wize wikale hano, mudu'gu' wanne.” Nawe wegelaga na wikalaga henanho. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Haho Bowasi wav'itanaga v'antu' iku'mi mugati' na v'anamala v'a kaya, wav'alombaga na v'ene v'ikale henanho. Nav'o v'ikalaga. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Hangi' Bowasi wamuwi'laga mudu'gu'ye ati', “Naomi, u'yo wasu'v'ile ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Mowabu, ali'gu'zya mugu'nda u'go yav'age nsawo ya mudu'gu' wiswe, Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Ene nawonaga yi'li' visoga nku'wi'le u'gu'le ha mbele ya minso ga v'antu' av'a, na ha mbele ya v'anamala v'a v'antu' v'anne. U'lu' u'gu'komola ninga u'kali' ku'gu'komola u'yombe, ku'nguno ku'du'hu' muntu' yu'ngi' wa ku'gu'komola ha lwandi' lwenu'lu' sumbwa ev'e, u'lu' waleka ev'e sanga ene.” Nawe wasu'v'yaga, “Ene nku'gu'komola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Haho Bowasi wamuwi'laga ati', “Lu'siku' u'lagu'gu'le mugu'nda gwenu'gu' ku'fuma ku'mwa Naomi, yi'laku'dime u'musole na u'yu' Luti, Mumowabu, mufwi'lwa, ki'gele kwendelezya lina lya muyagi haki'mo na nsawo zyakwe.” <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Hohene mwenu'yo mudu'gu' wa bi'hi' aho wigwa vyeni'vyo wayombaga, “Ene nkakowola ku'gu'komola, ku'nguno yi'li'wigela nku'v'ipya isaalo lyanne. Lwandi' lwanne lu'v'age lwandi' lwako, komolaga ev'e mweni'ki'li'. Ene nkakowola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Yav'age nsiku' zyeni'zyo mu nsi' ya Izilaeli, u'lu' v'antu' v'ali'koov'a ku'komola ninga ku'kaav'ana ki'ntu', yav'age ki'ti'lwe ku' muntu' ku'vula ki'latu' chakwe na ku'mupa mwiye. V'av'ezyage vyeni'vyo ku'lagi'la ku'v'a igambo lyagelani'ziwa. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Hohene muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwi'laga Bowasi ati', “Li'pi'la ev'e mugu'nda.” Haho wazulaga ki'latu' chakwe na wamupaga.<figure style="fig" file="co00971.jpg" size="col" ref="4:8">Bowasi ali'musaala Luti ha mbele ya v'anamala</figure><verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Nawe Bowasi wav'atangazi'zyaga v'anamala na v'antu' av'o v'av'age henanho, “Walelo yeni'yi' inywe muli' v'asangi'lwa v'anne. Mwawonaga i'vi nagu'laga ku'fuma ku'mwa Naomi vyose i'vyo vyav'age vyamwa Elimeleki, Kilioni na Maloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Hangi' Luti, Mumowabu, u'yo wav'age muki' wamwa Maloni, namusaalaga av'e muki' wanne, ki'gele kwendelezya lina lya muyagi ku'v'i'ti'la isaalo lyakwe, na ku'du' li'tagi'ke mugati' na wu'du'gu' wakwe, ninga ha wingi'li'lo wa kaya yeni'yi'. Walelo yeni'yi' inywe muli' v'asangi'lwa v'anne.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Nav'o v'anamala na v'antu' v'ose av'o v'av'age v'ali' henanho v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Endita, iswe ku'li' v'asangi'lwa v'ako. Gu'ku' Mulungu amuv'ezye muki'ma mwenu'yu' u'yo ali'wingi'la mu lu'go lwako av'e ki'ti' Lahele na Leya, v'enav'o v'av'i'li' hu' av'o v'ayi'zyenga kaya yamwa Izilaeli. Nanho u'pandi'ke tu'soga mu Efulati, u'v'e na lu'kumo mu kaya ya Betelehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kaya yako yikole na kaya yamwa Pelezi, u'yo Tamali wamuv'yali'la Yuda, ku'v'i'ti'la ku' v'av'yalwa av'o alaku'pe Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' muki'ma mwenu'yu'.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Bowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Hohene Bowasi wamusolaga Luti, nawe wav'aga muki' wakwe. Aho walalaga nawe, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuyali'laga Luti ku'v'a na mwitungo, nawe wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya.<verse eid="RUT 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Nav'o v'aki'ma v'a mu kaya yeni'yo v'amuwi'laga Naomi, “Akumu'kiwe Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo waku'paga walelo muntu' wa bi'hi' wa ku'ku'komola. Mwana mwenu'yu' lina lyakwe li'kumu'ke mu Izilaeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Nawe aku'ku'su'v'i'zya wu'zuwu'ku wako, na ku'ku'su'nga mu nsiku' zya wu'kiku'lu' wako, ku'nguno wav'yalagwa na mukamwana wako u'yo aku'togilwe. Luti aku'gelani'lile ku'ki'la v'ana mupungati' v'a ki'gosya.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Haho Naomi wamusolaga mwana mwenu'yo wamutu'u'laga ha ki'kuv'a chakwe, na wav'aga musu'ngi wakwe.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />V'aki'ma v'azenganwa v'akwe v'ayombaga, “Mwana wav'yalagwa hamwa Naomi.” V'amwitanaga lina lyakwe Obedi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Obedi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mutu'mami.” </char></note>. Mwenu'yu' hu' ise wamwa Yese, u'yo ise wamwa Dav'idi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Wenu'wu' hu' wu'v'yalwa wamwa Pelezi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:18">Pelezi wamuv'yalaga Heziloni,<verse eid="RUT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Heziloni wamuv'yalaga Lamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:19">Lamu wamuv'yalaga Aminadabu,<verse eid="RUT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu wamuv'yalaga Nashoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:20">Nashoni wamuv'yalaga Salomoni,<verse eid="RUT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salomoni wamuv'yalaga Bowasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:21">Bowasi wamuv'yalaga Obedi,<verse eid="RUT 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi wamuv'yalaga Yese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 4:22">na Yese wamuv'yalaga Dav'idi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>